# Forms & Validation

## Schemas live in `src/lib/validation/`
- `order.ts` — checkout + create order payload
- `product.ts` — admin product CRUD
- `profile.ts` — account profile

Export both schema and inferred type: `export type X = z.infer<typeof xSchema>`

## Client forms
- Use `react-hook-form` + `zodResolver(schema)`
- Show errors via component `error` prop; success/error toasts via `sonner`
- Import inputs from `@/components/ui`

## Server validation
- API routes re-validate with the same Zod schemas — never skip server-side validation

## Pakistan-specific fields
- Provinces: `PROVINCES` from `@/lib/validation/order`
- Payment methods: `cod | bank_transfer | jazzcash | easypaisa`
- Phone: normalize contact-app formatting, then require 10–15 digits
- Checkout line quantity is capped high (`10000`). Low or zero stock must not reject a customer order.
